    "title": "Nice Through the Weekend, Rain Chances Back Early Next Week! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joel Barnes ,\n1 days ago Very nice and pleasant weather is forecast to hang around West Tennessee for the rest of the week and last into the weekend. There could be a couple showers on Sunday but I wouldn’t count on it. Rain chances increase as we kick off next week. It is not a guarantee we are going to pick up some rain early next week but confidence is growing a little bit more each day. Highs will stay in the mid to upper 80s for the next 7-10 days. In the middle of October… we might finally see our first fall blast of the season. Catch the latest coming up right here. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
